function decodeBase32(value){const alphabet='ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ234567',clean=String(value||'').replace(/=+$/,'').toUpperCase();let bits='',out=[];for(const ch of clean){const n=alphabet.indexOf(ch);if(n<0)throw new Error('TOTP secret must use Base32 characters.');bits+=n.toString(2).padStart(5,'0')}for(let i=0;i+8<=bits.length;i+=8)out.push(parseInt(bits.slice(i,i+8),2));return Buffer.from(out)}
